## Returns and support

Halfday does not accept product returns or exchanges. Report products damaged in transit or incorrect orders immediately to hey@drinkhalfday.com. Read Section 21 of the Terms of Service for the complete terms. For purchases through Amazon or another retailer, use that seller's order-help process and applicable policies.

- [Contact Halfday](https://drinkhalfday.com/pages/contact)
- [Terms of Service, including returns](https://drinkhalfday.com/pages/terms-of-service)
- [Privacy Policy](https://drinkhalfday.com/pages/privacy-policy)

